      "cooked": "<p>Hi! I’ve been struggling to grasp how to name documents using a naming series. I’ve spent several hours trying to figure it out and haven’t made much progress.</p>\n<p>In this case, I am trying to use a naming series for items to generate item codes with format CP-.#####</p>\n<p>I have tried every combination I can find of the standard naming series (found in Document Naming Settings), Document Naming Rules and even setting the form settings to just generate a random hash. None of them work.</p>\n<p>It seems like the issue is that in the DocType Item, the naming settings are set to the item_code fieldname, so settings I change elsewhere (such as customize form) are getting overwritten by the doctype settings, which I can’t edit.</p>\n<p>Is it possible to generate custom item codes? If so how?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/d/9d2b9474fed752663cf22fc42ed0d90a928475c6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9d2b9474fed752663cf22fc42ed0d90a928475c6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/d/9d2b9474fed752663cf22fc42ed0d90a928475c6_2_690x141.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mqokBHfvUzuG49npC9QNa8v99ZQ\" width=\"690\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/d/9d2b9474fed752663cf22fc42ed0d90a928475c6_2_690x141.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/d/9d2b9474fed752663cf22fc42ed0d90a928475c6_2_1035x211.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/d/9d2b9474fed752663cf22fc42ed0d90a928475c6_2_1380x282.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1A242C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1565×321 23 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>(on V16.9 of ERPNext running on Frappe Cloud)</p>",
